<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat cash bids were mixed on Thursday as dealers noted a lack of movement.</p>
<p>&quot;There is nothing new,&quot; one said. &quot;We are just watching the (MGE) board.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;Farmers are not selling,&quot; a Montana merchandiser said.</p>
<p>But he said rain and snow in Montana hampered some winter wheat seeding.</p>
<p>MGE December spring wheat firmed 1/4 cent to end at $420.1/4 a bushel.  </p>
